{"title":"박수무당 백처용","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=LKpeE/hAd4R1FPoH/ktPZARIefSqNSlJ72keAPK&filename=th3","synopsis":"\"아저씨도 보여요? 저도 보여요, 귀신.\"\n\n신력을 잃고 모시던 신까지 떠난 박수무당 백처용.\n빛나던 무당 생활은 점점 초라해지기만 한다.\n\n 그때, 모시던 동자보살이 꿈에 나타나\n'곧 네 팔자를 필 귀인'이 올 거라는 한 마디를 남긴다.\n \n 이후 필연처럼 마주친 여고생 강지윤.\n귀신이 보이는 눈을 고쳐줄 수 있느냐고 묻는데…\n\n백처용에겐 지윤의 '귀안'이 간절하기만 하다.\n귀안 없는 무당, 귀신 보는 학생. 둘은 모종의 거래를 시작한다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":252,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-10-18","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-10-19","rank":223,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":2125501,"rc":8296,"rs":82489,"cc":3033},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":2125508,"rc":8296,"rs":82489,"cc":3033},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":2125526,"rc":8297,"rs":82499,"cc":3033},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":2125537,"rc":8297,"rs":82499,"cc":3033},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":2125624,"rc":8299,"rs":82519,"cc":3033},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":2125730,"rc":8299,"rs":82519,"cc":3032},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":2125765,"rc":8299,"rs":82519,"cc":3032},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":2125788,"rc":8299,"rs":82519,"cc":3032},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":2125837,"rc":8299,"rs":82519,"cc":3032}]}